<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<bpmn:definitions xmlns:bpmn="http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/MODEL" xmlns:bpmndi="http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/DI" xmlns:dc="http://www.omg.org/spec/DD/20100524/DC" xmlns:di="http://www.omg.org/spec/DD/20100524/DI" id="Definitions_PA-192.1-green-fleet-strategy-electrification-roadmap-and-capital-planning" targetNamespace="https://erpplans.local/bpmn" exporter="erpplans generate-bpmn.py" exporterVersion="1.0">
    <bpmn:process id="W_W5465" name="W5465. Green Fleet Strategy, Emissions Baseline &amp; Decarbonization Target Setting" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: ESG/net-zero commitment (VS-25); RA 11697 EVIDA roadmap; annual strategy cycle
Frequency: Annual strategy refresh; baseline established once, re-baselined biennially
Volume: 1 corporate strategy; spans the owned fleet (~20% of outbound distribution, VS-06) + rental (VS-162/VS-186) + shuttle (VS-141) + jobsite-delivery (VS-74) ≈ several hundred vehicles
Owner: Head of Supply Chain &amp; Logistics (COO org)
Participants: ESG/Sustainability (VS-25), Fleet Ops (VS-06), Treasury (VS-18), Facilities/Energy (VS-120/VS-138), Real Estate (VS-97)
Source: workflow W5465 — Green Fleet Strategy, Emissions Baseline &amp; Decarbonization Target Setting</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W5465_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W5465_Lane1" name="Fleet">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5465_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5465_Task9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5465_Start5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W5465_Lane2" name="ESG">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5465_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5465_Task10</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W5465_Lane3" name="Head of Supply Chain &amp; Logistics">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5465_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5465_End11</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W5465_Start5" name="ESG/net-zero commitment (VS-25); RA 11697 EVIDA roadmap; annual strategy cycle">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5465_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5465_Task6" name="Establish the Scope 1 fleet emissions baseline from fuel-consumption records…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Establish the Scope 1 fleet emissions baseline from fuel-consumption records (VS-61), telematics (VS-06), and 3PL carrier data: diesel/gasoline litres, kilometres, load factors, by vehicle class and lane.
Responsible (R): Fleet/ESG Analyst
Accountable (A): Head of Supply Chain &amp; Logistics
Duration: 4–6 weeks/baseline</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5465_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5465_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5465_Task7" name="Set the multi-year decarbonization target (absolute tCO₂e and intensity…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Set the multi-year decarbonization target (absolute tCO₂e and intensity gCO₂e/tonne-km), aligned to any corporate SBTi/net-zero ambition and the EVIDA fleet-EV-share expectation; define the milestone years (e.g., −X% by 2030).
Responsible (R): ESG/Sustainability
Accountable (A): Head of Supply Chain &amp; Logistics
Duration: per cycle</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5465_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5465_Flow16</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5465_Task8" name="Define the green-fleet strategy mix: battery-electric (where range/payload…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Define the green-fleet strategy mix: battery-electric (where range/payload fit), plug-in hybrid (transition), biodiesel/B20 (drop-in for existing diesel), LNG/CNG (heavy line-haul if viable), and route/modal shifts; document the &quot;no-regret&quot; early lanes (urban last-mile, store-replenishment shuttles, intra-DC).
Responsible (R): Head of Supply Chain &amp; Logistics
Accountable (A): COO
Duration: per cycle</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5465_Flow16</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5465_Flow17</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5465_Task9" name="Identify dependencies and interlocks: charging/alt-fuel infrastructure (W5468)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Identify dependencies and interlocks: charging/alt-fuel infrastructure (W5468), grid/utility capacity (VS-120), own-solar generation (VS-108), EVIDA incentives (W5470), and the 3PL-carrier green clause path (W5485).
Responsible (R): Fleet/ESG Analyst
Accountable (A): Head of Supply Chain &amp; Logistics
Duration: per cycle</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5465_Flow17</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5465_Flow18</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5465_Task10" name="Publish the strategy to the board (links VS-25 ESG governance and VS-33…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 5: Publish the strategy to the board (links VS-25 ESG governance and VS-33 strategy) and feed it into the capital plan (W5471) and the transition roadmap (W5466).
Responsible (R): ESG/Sustainability / COO
Accountable (A): CEO
Duration: per cycle</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5465_Flow18</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5465_Flow19</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W5465_End11" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W5465_Flow19</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W5465_Annotation12">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-806: baseline data evidence; CTL-02 (capital approval gate); operational: documented methodology consistent with GHG Protocol Corporate Standard, reviewed by ESG/Finance before board submission.
Owner: Head of Supply Chain &amp; Logistics (COO org)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W5465_Assoc13" sourceRef="W5465_Annotation12" targetRef="W5465_Start5" associationDirection="None" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W5465_Flow14" sourceRef="W5465_Start5" targetRef="W5465_Task6" />
