    <bpmn:process id="W_W5466" name="W5466. Fleet Asset Inventory, Electrification Readiness Assessment &amp; Transition Roadmap" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Strategy approved (W5465); annual fleet plan
Frequency: Annual roadmap refresh; per asset-class readiness wave
Volume: ~40 owned fleet vehicles by class (10-wheeler wing vans, 6-wheelers, light delivery, service vans — the ~20%-owned share of the ~200-truck fleet)
Owner: Fleet Manager (VS-06)
Participants: Real Estate (VS-97), Facilities/Energy (VS-138/VS-120), Supply Planning (VS-02), Maintenance (VS-06.2)
Source: workflow W5466 — Fleet Asset Inventory, Electrification Readiness Assessment &amp; Transition Roadmap</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W5466_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W5466_Lane1" name="Fleet Analyst">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5466_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5466_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5466_Start5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W5466_Lane2" name="Fleet Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5466_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5466_Task10</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W5466_Lane3" name="Facilities">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5466_Task9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5466_End11</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W5466_Start5" name="Strategy approved (W5465); annual fleet plan">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5466_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5466_Task6" name="Build the fleet asset register: vehicle ID, class, age, odometer, residual…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Build the fleet asset register: vehicle ID, class, age, odometer, residual life, current fuel, duty cycle (route, daily km, payload, dwell), ownership (owned vs leased vs 3PL), and assigned DC/region.
Responsible (R): Fleet Analyst
Accountable (A): Fleet Manager
Duration: per refresh</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5466_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5466_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5466_Task7" name="Score each asset/class for electrification readiness: daily-km vs BEV range…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Score each asset/class for electrification readiness: daily-km vs BEV range, payload vs battery-penalty, route topology (grade, heat, A/C load), overnight dwell availability, and replacement-point timing.
Responsible (R): Fleet Analyst
Accountable (A): Fleet Manager
Duration: per wave</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5466_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5466_Flow16</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5466_Task8" name="Sequence the transition into waves by &quot;no-regret&quot; lanes first (fixed urban…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Sequence the transition into waves by &quot;no-regret&quot; lanes first (fixed urban routes, intra-DC, store-replenishment shuttles, employee shuttles) and defer hard cases (inter-island line-haul, heavy equipment) to later waves or alt-fuel.
Responsible (R): Fleet Manager
Accountable (A): Head of Supply Chain &amp; Logistics
Duration: per roadmap</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5466_Flow16</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5466_Flow17</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5466_Task9" name="Map infrastructure dependencies per wave: which DCs/stores need charging…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Map infrastructure dependencies per wave: which DCs/stores need charging (W5468), grid upgrades, and solar-matching (VS-108); flag sites that cannot host charging.
Responsible (R): Facilities/Energy
Accountable (A): Fleet Manager
Duration: per wave</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5466_Flow17</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5466_Flow18</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5466_Task10" name="Publish the roadmap (wave schedule, vehicle counts, infrastructure, capital…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 5: Publish the roadmap (wave schedule, vehicle counts, infrastructure, capital, expected tCO₂e reduction per wave) and feed capital governance (W5471).
Responsible (R): Fleet Manager
Accountable (A): Head of Supply Chain &amp; Logistics
Duration: per refresh</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5466_Flow18</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5466_Flow19</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W5466_End11" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W5466_Flow19</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W5466_Annotation12">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-806: asset-register and readiness evidence; CTL-02 (roadmap/capital approval); operational: p95 duty-cycle design rule documented per vehicle class.
Owner: Fleet Manager (VS-06)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W5466_Assoc13" sourceRef="W5466_Annotation12" targetRef="W5466_Start5" associationDirection="None" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W5466_Flow14" sourceRef="W5466_Start5" targetRef="W5466_Task6" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W5466_Flow15" sourceRef="W5466_Task6" targetRef="W5466_Task7" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W5466_Flow16" sourceRef="W5466_Task7" targetRef="W5466_Task8" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W5466_Flow17" sourceRef="W5466_Task8" targetRef="W5466_Task9" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W5466_Flow18" sourceRef="W5466_Task9" targetRef="W5466_Task10" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W5466_Flow19" sourceRef="W5466_Task10" targetRef="W5466_End11" />
    </bpmn:process>
