    <bpmn:process id="W_W5467" name="W5467. Electric &amp; Alternative-Fuel Vehicle Procurement, OEM Vendor Selection &amp; Homologation" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Transition wave approved (W5466); vehicle replacement cycle
Frequency: Per wave / per procurement event
Volume: Tens of vehicles per wave early, scaling to larger batches; ~multi-year program
Owner: Fleet Procurement Lead (VS-03/VS-06)
Participants: OEM/dealers, Treasury (VS-18), Maintenance (VS-06.2), Legal (VS-100), TPRM (VS-161)
Source: workflow W5467 — Electric &amp; Alternative-Fuel Vehicle Procurement, OEM Vendor Selection &amp; Homologation</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W5467_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W5467_Lane1" name="Fleet Procurement Lead">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5467_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5467_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W5467_Lane2" name="Fleet Procurement">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5467_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5467_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5467_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5467_Task9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5467_End10</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W5467_Start4" name="Transition wave approved (W5466); vehicle replacement cycle">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5467_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5467_Task5" name="Develop the RFQ/spec per vehicle class: drivetrain (BEV/PHEV/biodiesel/LNG)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Develop the RFQ/spec per vehicle class: drivetrain (BEV/PHEV/biodiesel/LNG), range, payload, charging standard (CCS2/GB/T/Type-2 per PH market), warranty, battery degradation guarantee, and spare-parts/after-sales support in the Philippines.
Responsible (R): Fleet Procurement Lead
Accountable (A): Fleet Manager
Duration: per class</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5467_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5467_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5467_Task6" name="Qualify OEMs/dealers via TPRM (VS-161): financial viability, PH service-network…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Qualify OEMs/dealers via TPRM (VS-161): financial viability, PH service-network coverage across the 200-store footprint, recall history, and battery/parts lead times; shortlist 2–3 per class.
Responsible (R): Fleet Procurement / TPRM
Accountable (A): Fleet Manager
Duration: per class</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5467_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5467_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5467_Task7" name="Validate LTO homologation / type-approval status of each candidate model for…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Validate LTO homologation / type-approval status of each candidate model for Philippine registration (conformance to PNS for EVs, LTO MV-2019-2207 series); reject models lacking valid import/type approval.
Responsible (R): Fleet Procurement / Legal
Accountable (A): Fleet Manager
Duration: per model</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5467_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5467_Flow16</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5467_Task8" name="Negotiate price, warranty, battery-capacity guarantee (e.g., ≥70% at…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Negotiate price, warranty, battery-capacity guarantee (e.g., ≥70% at 5-yr/300k-km), service-level, parts availability, and buy-back/end-of-life terms (links W5487).
Responsible (R): Fleet Procurement / Legal
Accountable (A): Fleet Manager
Duration: per event</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5467_Flow16</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5467_Flow17</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5467_Task9" name="Execute the PO/lease (outright, finance lease, or full-service lease — link…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 5: Execute the PO/lease (outright, finance lease, or full-service lease — link VS-96/VS-18), arrange delivery, registration (W5470), telematics fitment, and handover to Fleet Ops (VS-06.2).
Responsible (R): Fleet Procurement / Treasury
Accountable (A): Fleet Manager
Duration: per event</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5467_Flow17</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5467_Flow18</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W5467_End10" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W5467_Flow18</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
