        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-806: procurement/vendor approval; CTL-02 (capital approval); CTL-44 (duplicate-PO/invoice guard); operational: LTO homologation verification mandatory before PO release.
Owner: Fleet Procurement Lead (VS-03/VS-06)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
