    <bpmn:process id="W_W5468" name="W5468. Depot / DC Charging &amp; Alt-Fuel Infrastructure Planning, Siting &amp; Grid Coordination" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Transition wave approved (W5466); new DC/store build (VS-20/VS-37); remodel (VS-109)
Frequency: Per wave / per site infrastructure project
Volume: 4 DCs + 200 stores (charging candidates); phased over years
Owner: Facilities &amp; Energy Manager (VS-138/VS-120)
Participants: Fleet (VS-06), Real Estate (VS-97), Distribution Utility / EV-charger vendor (VS-163), Treasury (VS-18), ESG (VS-25)
Source: workflow W5468 — Depot / DC Charging &amp; Alt-Fuel Infrastructure Planning, Siting &amp; Grid Coordination</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W5468_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W5468_Lane1" name="Facilities">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5468_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5468_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5468_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5468_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5468_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5468_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5468_End9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W5468_Start3" name="Transition wave approved (W5466); new DC/store build (VS-20/VS-37); remodel (VS-109)">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5468_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5468_Task4" name="Per site, model the fleet-charging load (kW, kWh/day, simultaneous-charge…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Per site, model the fleet-charging load (kW, kWh/day, simultaneous-charge count) from the wave&#x27;s vehicle assignments and duty cycles (W5466); co-plan with the existing customer-host network (VS-163) to share infrastructure where sensible.
Responsible (R): Facilities/Energy Analyst
Accountable (A): Facilities &amp; Energy Manager
Duration: per site</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5468_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5468_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5468_Task5" name="Assess site electrical capacity (transformer kVA, switchgear, panel headroom)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Assess site electrical capacity (transformer kVA, switchgear, panel headroom) and the distribution utility&#x27;s service-drop/upgrade requirements; coordinate any transformer/grid upgrade and the utility connection application.
Responsible (R): Facilities / Distribution Utility
Accountable (A): Facilities &amp; Energy Manager
Duration: per site</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5468_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5468_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5468_Task6" name="Size and site the chargers (AC Level 2 for overnight dwell; DC fast-charge for…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Size and site the chargers (AC Level 2 for overnight dwell; DC fast-charge for opportunity/turnaround), electrical infrastructure, and any on-site solar+battery matching (VS-108) to flatten peak demand and cost.
Responsible (R): Facilities / Solar EPC (VS-108)
Accountable (A): Facilities &amp; Energy Manager
Duration: per site</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5468_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5468_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5468_Task7" name="For alt-fuel (biodiesel/LNG), plan storage/dispensing, fire-code (BFP)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: For alt-fuel (biodiesel/LNG), plan storage/dispensing, fire-code (BFP) compliance, and supply logistics (links VS-61 fuel, VS-114 DG where applicable).
Responsible (R): Facilities / HSE (VS-24)
Accountable (A): Facilities &amp; Energy Manager
Duration: per site</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5468_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5468_Flow16</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5468_Task8" name="Secure permits (LGU electrical permit, BFP, ERC/DU), commission (links…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 5: Secure permits (LGU electrical permit, BFP, ERC/DU), commission (links VS-37/VS-138 commissioning), integrate into charging operations (W5473), and record the asset (VS-35).
Responsible (R): Facilities / Legal
Accountable (A): Facilities &amp; Energy Manager
Duration: per site</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5468_Flow16</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5468_Flow17</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W5468_End9" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W5468_Flow17</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W5468_Annotation10">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-806: capital approval; CTL-02 (capex authorization); LGU/BFP permit evidence; CTL-09 (EPC/vendor TPRM); operational: transformer-capacity sign-off before charger procurement; HSE/Fire-Code review mandatory.
Owner: Facilities &amp; Energy Manager (VS-138/VS-120)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
