    <bpmn:process id="W_W5469" name="W5469. Green Fleet Total Cost of Ownership (TCO), Lifecycle &amp; Capital Investment Analysis" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Procurement decision (W5467); annual capital plan; strategy refresh
Frequency: Per vehicle-class decision; annual model refresh
Volume: Per decision (vehicle class × ownership mode); ~few-to-tens of decisions/yr
Owner: Logistics Finance Analyst (VS-17.4/VS-158)
Participants: Fleet (VS-06), Treasury (VS-18), ESG (VS-25), Procurement (VS-03)
Source: workflow W5469 — Green Fleet Total Cost of Ownership (TCO), Lifecycle &amp; Capital Investment Analysis</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W5469_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W5469_Lane1" name="Logistics Finance Analyst">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5469_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5469_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5469_Task10</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5469_Start5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W5469_Lane2" name="ESG">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5469_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W5469_Lane3" name="Finance">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5469_Task9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5469_End11</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W5469_Start5" name="Procurement decision (W5467); annual capital plan; strategy refresh">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5469_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5469_Task6" name="Build the TCO model per vehicle class and ownership mode (outright / finance…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Build the TCO model per vehicle class and ownership mode (outright / finance lease / full-service lease): capex, electricity vs diesel cost (VS-61/W5486), maintenance (EV lower, battery replacement reserve), insurance (VS-26), tyres, residual value, and EVIDA incentives (W5470).
Responsible (R): Logistics Finance Analyst
Accountable (A): CFO / Head of Supply Chain
Duration: per decision</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5469_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5469_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5469_Task7" name="Quantify the carbon-cost benefit (tCO₂e avoided × internal/external carbon…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Quantify the carbon-cost benefit (tCO₂e avoided × internal/external carbon price) and any ESG-cost-of-capital benefit; include the social cost where the board adopts it.
Responsible (R): ESG / Finance
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: per decision</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5469_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5469_Flow16</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5469_Task8" name="Sensitivity-test the model on the high-uncertainty variables (electricity…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Sensitivity-test the model on the high-uncertainty variables (electricity tariff, battery replacement cost, residual value, diesel-price path, incentive availability) and identify break-even vs diesel.
Responsible (R): Logistics Finance Analyst
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: per decision</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5469_Flow16</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5469_Flow17</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5469_Task9" name="Compare ownership modes (own vs lease vs full-service) and make/buy (owned…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Compare ownership modes (own vs lease vs full-service) and make/buy (owned fleet vs 3PL with green clause W5485); recommend the value-maximizing structure.
Responsible (R): Finance / Fleet
Accountable (A): CFO / COO
Duration: per decision</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5469_Flow17</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5469_Flow18</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5469_Task10" name="Document the business case for capital governance (W5471) and post-investment…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 5: Document the business case for capital governance (W5471) and post-investment benefit tracking (W5488).
Responsible (R): Logistics Finance Analyst
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: per decision</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5469_Flow18</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5469_Flow19</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W5469_End11" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W5469_Flow19</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W5469_Annotation12">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-806: TCO evidence/assumptions documented; CTL-02 (capital approval gate); CTL-33 (post-investment review evidence); operational: no-incentive break-even test mandatory; conservative residual policy.
Owner: Logistics Finance Analyst (VS-17.4/VS-158)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W5469_Assoc13" sourceRef="W5469_Annotation12" targetRef="W5469_Start5" associationDirection="None" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W5469_Flow14" sourceRef="W5469_Start5" targetRef="W5469_Task6" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W5469_Flow15" sourceRef="W5469_Task6" targetRef="W5469_Task7" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W5469_Flow16" sourceRef="W5469_Task7" targetRef="W5469_Task8" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W5469_Flow17" sourceRef="W5469_Task8" targetRef="W5469_Task9" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W5469_Flow18" sourceRef="W5469_Task9" targetRef="W5469_Task10" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W5469_Flow19" sourceRef="W5469_Task10" targetRef="W5469_End11" />
    </bpmn:process>
    <bpmndi:BPMNDiagram id="W5469_diag">
      <bpmndi:BPMNPlane id="W5469_plane" bpmnElement="W_W5469">
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W5469_Lane1_di" bpmnElement="W5469_Lane1" isHorizontal="true"><dc:Bounds x="160" y="80" width="1370" height="170" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W5469_Lane2_di" bpmnElement="W5469_Lane2" isHorizontal="true"><dc:Bounds x="160" y="250" width="1370" height="170" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W5469_Lane3_di" bpmnElement="W5469_Lane3" isHorizontal="true"><dc:Bounds x="160" y="420" width="1370" height="170" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W5469_Task6_di" bpmnElement="W5469_Task6"><dc:Bounds x="400" y="125" width="180" height="80" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W5469_Task7_di" bpmnElement="W5469_Task7"><dc:Bounds x="610" y="295" width="180" height="80" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
