    <bpmn:process id="W_W5470" name="W5470. RA 11697 (EVIDA) Incentives, EV Registration, Toll/Lane Exemption &amp; Compliance Management" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: EV/alt-fuel vehicle purchase (W5467); annual incentive filing; regulatory change
Frequency: Per vehicle registration + annual incentive cycle
Volume: Per green-fleet vehicle; scales with fleet conversion
Owner: Regulatory &amp; Compliance Officer (VS-22/VS-166)
Participants: Fleet (VS-06), Tax (VS-79), Legal (VS-100), Treasury (VS-18)
Source: workflow W5470 — RA 11697 (EVIDA) Incentives, EV Registration, Toll/Lane Exemption &amp; Compliance Management</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W5470_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W5470_Lane1" name="Regulatory Officer">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5470_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5470_Task9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5470_Task10</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5470_Start5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W5470_Lane2" name="Regulatory">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5470_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W5470_Lane3" name="Fleet">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5470_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5470_End11</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W5470_Start5" name="EV/alt-fuel vehicle purchase (W5467); annual incentive filing; regulatory change">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5470_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5470_Task6" name="Track EVIDA (RA 11697) and its DOE IRR incentives applicable to commercial…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Track EVIDA (RA 11697) and its DOE IRR incentives applicable to commercial fleet EVs — fiscal (customs duty exemption on EV/PHEV parts, income tax) and non-fiscal (priority lane, toll, parking, exemption from number-coding) — and the BOI/EV roadmap registration path.
Responsible (R): Regulatory Officer
Accountable (A): VP Legal &amp; Compliance
Duration: per cycle</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5470_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5470_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5470_Task7" name="File for and secure the applicable incentives (BOI registration, customs…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: File for and secure the applicable incentives (BOI registration, customs duty-free importation of EV parts, and any fleet-incentive schemes); coordinate with Tax (VS-79) on the fiscal benefit.
Responsible (R): Regulatory / Tax
Accountable (A): VP Legal &amp; Compliance
Duration: per filing</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5470_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5470_Flow16</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5470_Task8" name="Register each EV/alt-fuel vehicle with the LTO under the EV-specific…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Register each EV/alt-fuel vehicle with the LTO under the EV-specific registration path (EV plates/decals per LTO guidance) and maintain franchise/LTFRB compliance for goods/for-hire vehicles.
Responsible (R): Fleet / Regulatory
Accountable (A): Fleet Manager
Duration: per vehicle</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5470_Flow16</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5470_Flow17</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5470_Task9" name="Maintain the green-fleet license/permit register (EV registration, BOI, LGU…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Maintain the green-fleet license/permit register (EV registration, BOI, LGU EV-parking compliance) in the central compliance portfolio (VS-166) with renewal/expiry tracking.
Responsible (R): Regulatory Officer
Accountable (A): VP Legal &amp; Compliance
Duration: ongoing</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5470_Flow17</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5470_Flow18</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5470_Task10" name="Monitor regulatory change (EVIDA IRR amendments, DOE EV roadmap updates, LGU…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 5: Monitor regulatory change (EVIDA IRR amendments, DOE EV roadmap updates, LGU EV-parking ordinances under RA 11697 §building/Parking provisions) and update the program accordingly.
Responsible (R): Regulatory Officer
Accountable (A): VP Legal &amp; Compliance
Duration: ongoing</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5470_Flow18</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5470_Flow19</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W5470_End11" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W5470_Flow19</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W5470_Annotation12">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-806: regulatory permit/registration verification; tax-incentive compliance evidence; BOI/broker TPRM evidence; operational: EV LTO registration verified before in-service date.
Owner: Regulatory &amp; Compliance Officer (VS-22/VS-166)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W5470_Assoc13" sourceRef="W5470_Annotation12" targetRef="W5470_Start5" associationDirection="None" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W5470_Flow14" sourceRef="W5470_Start5" targetRef="W5470_Task6" />
