    <bpmn:process id="W_W5471" name="W5471. Green Fleet Capital Governance, Financing &amp; Board Investment Approval" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: TCO/business case ready (W5469); wave capital request
Frequency: Per wave / per major capital event
Volume: Multi-year program; waves of PHP tens-to-hundreds of millions
Owner: Fleet Manager / Logistics Finance (VS-06/VS-17.4)
Participants: CFO, Treasury (VS-18), PMO (VS-112), Capex Accounting (VS-40), Board (VS-36)
Source: workflow W5471 — Green Fleet Capital Governance, Financing &amp; Board Investment Approval</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W5471_LaneSet5">
        <bpmn:lane id="W5471_Lane1" name="Fleet">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5471_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5471_Start6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W5471_Lane2" name="Capex Accounting">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5471_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5471_Task10</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W5471_Lane3" name="Treasury">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5471_Task9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W5471_Lane4" name="Logistics Finance">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5471_Task11</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5471_End12</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W5471_Start6" name="TCO/business case ready (W5469); wave capital request">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5471_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5471_Task7" name="Package the wave capital request: vehicle capex, charging/alt-fuel…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Package the wave capital request: vehicle capex, charging/alt-fuel infrastructure (W5468), grid/utility upgrades, contingency, financing structure, and the TCO/ESG business case (W5469).
Responsible (R): Fleet / Logistics Finance
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: per wave</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5471_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5471_Flow16</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5471_Task8" name="Route through the tiered capex-approval matrix (VS-40): within-delegation, CFO…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Route through the tiered capex-approval matrix (VS-40): within-delegation, CFO, CEO, or Board/Investment Committee above threshold; stage-gate each wave per the PMO (VS-112).
Responsible (R): Capex Accounting / PMO
Accountable (A): CEO / Board
Duration: per wave</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5471_Flow16</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5471_Flow17</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5471_Task9" name="Arrange financing (own cash, finance lease, full-service lease…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Arrange financing (own cash, finance lease, full-service lease, green-loan/sustainability-linked facility — links VS-18) and align covenant treatment with existing facilities (VS-170).
Responsible (R): Treasury
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: per event</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5471_Flow17</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5471_Flow18</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5471_Task10" name="Authorize procurement release (W5467) and infrastructure commissioning (W5468)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Authorize procurement release (W5467) and infrastructure commissioning (W5468) only on capital approval; track commitments/CIP/turnover in capex accounting (VS-40).
Responsible (R): Capex Accounting / Fleet
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: per event</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5471_Flow18</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5471_Flow19</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5471_Task11" name="Establish the post-investment benefit-realization baseline (ex-ante tCO₂e, TCO)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 5: Establish the post-investment benefit-realization baseline (ex-ante tCO₂e, TCO) for tracking in W5488 and board ESG reporting (VS-25/VS-173).
Responsible (R): Logistics Finance / ESG
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: per wave</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5471_Flow19</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5471_Flow20</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W5471_End12" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W5471_Flow20</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W5471_Annotation13">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-806: capital/strategic approval gate; CTL-33 (post-investment review); business-case evidence retained; operational: stage-gate mandatory per wave; ex-ante baseline locked before approval.
Owner: Fleet Manager / Logistics Finance (VS-06/VS-17.4)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W5471_Assoc14" sourceRef="W5471_Annotation13" targetRef="W5471_Start6" associationDirection="None" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W5471_Flow15" sourceRef="W5471_Start6" targetRef="W5471_Task7" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W5471_Flow16" sourceRef="W5471_Task7" targetRef="W5471_Task8" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W5471_Flow17" sourceRef="W5471_Task8" targetRef="W5471_Task9" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W5471_Flow18" sourceRef="W5471_Task9" targetRef="W5471_Task10" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W5471_Flow19" sourceRef="W5471_Task10" targetRef="W5471_Task11" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W5471_Flow20" sourceRef="W5471_Task11" targetRef="W5471_End12" />
    </bpmn:process>
