    <bpmn:process id="W_W5472" name="W5472. Delivery Network &amp; Route Re-Design for EV Range, Charging &amp; Payload Constraints" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: EV/alt-fuel vehicles entering service (W5467); network change; annual network review (VS-136)
Frequency: Per wave / per network-design cycle
Volume: Affected lanes across 4 DCs → 200 stores + last-mile + jobsite delivery
Owner: Network &amp; Transportation Planning Lead (VS-136/VS-06)
Participants: Supply Planning (VS-02), Fleet (VS-06), Store Ops (VS-177), Last-Mile (VS-06.3/VS-56)
Source: workflow W5472 — Delivery Network &amp; Route Re-Design for EV Range, Charging &amp; Payload Constraints</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W5472_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W5472_Lane1" name="Network Planner">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5472_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5472_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5472_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5472_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5472_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5472_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5472_End9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W5472_Start3" name="EV/alt-fuel vehicles entering service (W5467); network change; annual network review…">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5472_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5472_Task4" name="Map the current lane/route structure (DC→store, store→customer, intra-DC…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Map the current lane/route structure (DC→store, store→customer, intra-DC, jobsite) with distances, grades, climate load, dwell, and payload; identify EV-suitable vs diesel-only lanes from the readiness assessment (W5466).
Responsible (R): Network Planner
Accountable (A): Network &amp; Transportation Planning Lead
Duration: per cycle</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5472_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5472_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5472_Task5" name="Re-design routes to respect EV range and charging constraints: segment long…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Re-design routes to respect EV range and charging constraints: segment long lanes at charging points, re-cluster delivery territories around DC/charging hubs, and sequence stops to minimize km and climb.
Responsible (R): Network Planner
Accountable (A): Network &amp; Transportation Planning Lead
Duration: per cycle</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5472_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5472_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5472_Task6" name="Re-plan payload/cube to account for battery weight/penalty and any reduced…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Re-plan payload/cube to account for battery weight/penalty and any reduced payload; adjust replenishment frequency (links VS-02) where payload loss affects order coverage.
Responsible (R): Network Planner / Supply Planning
Accountable (A): Network &amp; Transportation Planning Lead
Duration: per cycle</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5472_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5472_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5472_Task7" name="Integrate charging-stops and opportunity-charging into route plans (links…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Integrate charging-stops and opportunity-charging into route plans (links W5473/W5474) and define fallback/diesel-coverage for peak days and EV-unavailable events.
Responsible (R): Network Planner / Fleet
Accountable (A): Network &amp; Transportation Planning Lead
Duration: per cycle</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5472_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5472_Flow16</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5472_Task8" name="Re-baseline route KPIs (km/run, on-time, cost/run, gCO₂e/tonne-km), publish the…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 5: Re-baseline route KPIs (km/run, on-time, cost/run, gCO₂e/tonne-km), publish the re-designed network, and feed dispatch (W5477) and analytics (W5488).
Responsible (R): Network Planner
Accountable (A): Network &amp; Transportation Planning Lead
Duration: per cycle</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5472_Flow16</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5472_Flow17</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W5472_End9" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W5472_Flow17</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W5472_Annotation10">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-806: network-design evidence; CTL-02 (network-change capital approval); operational: p95-duty-cycle design rule; fallback-usage KPI ceiling.
Owner: Network &amp; Transportation Planning Lead (VS-136/VS-06)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
